(7427798, 1173705, 61552, '<td valign="top">Although a watch is small, it''s supposed to occupy a small portion of the image space.</td>', 'Although a watch is small, it''s supposed to occupy a small portion of the image space.', '2016-01-13 00:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7427847, 1173279, 181756, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the monochromatic theme and the mystery of the original subject.  But the digital artifacts / pixelation distract me just a bit and cause me to think the picture is still loading.</td>', 'I appreciate the monochromatic theme and the mystery of the original subject.  But the digital artifacts / pixelation distract me just a bit and cause me to think the picture is still loading.', '2016-01-13 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7427849, 1173873, 181756, '<td valign="top">When I look at this picture, I can almost hear the thunk of porcelain bowls on wood and the muted tinks of bamboo on ever emptying bowls.  Nice composition, nice low lighting.  This image leaves the table open for the viewers'' imaginations to fill in the rest.</td>', 'When I look at this picture, I can almost hear the thunk of porcelain bowls on wood and the muted tinks of bamboo on ever emptying bowls.  Nice composition, nice low lighting.  This image leaves the table open for the viewers'' imaginations to fill in the rest.', '2016-01-13 06:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
